WEBVTT

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:04.320
Messages keeps club updates
and their app links together.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.164
Choose the people
who need this message.

00:00:08.164 --> 00:00:16.752
Give the update a clear title.

00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:20.455
Link straight to
the relevant app screen.

00:00:20.455 --> 00:00:26.369
Phone alerts where enabled.
An email link otherwise.

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:36.818
Player view:
open the message in the app.
